{"4714290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Descend", "steam_appid": 4714290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend is an upcoming Roguelite ARPG. It combines the exciting combat, looting and build crafting of a traditional ARPG with a Roguelite run structure. Slay hordes of enemies to gain procedural skills, augments and loot to shape your build and fight deeper. Descend is set apart with a unique skill system, run-altering persistent upgrades, and an evolving quest system that influences gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your character with real time action combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge roll out of the way of attacks, move while casting, use charged skills for more impact, set up devastating damage conditions with status effects, and more. Do all of this with WASD and controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/d873fb4c3e29c3b87abb95a677c4207b.poster.avif?t=1780964492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/d873fb4c3e29c3b87abb95a677c4207b.webm?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/d873fb4c3e29c3b87abb95a677c4207b.mp4?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Skill System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot procedurally generated Skills with dynamically created skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socketed Skill Augments boost not only a Skill's power but dynamically change how it behaves. Turn a Fireball into a multishot projectile, make them bounce off walls, increase their stats, explode on impact and countless more combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/bc18d7b12a03d19e2764f7c20ee9784d.poster.avif?t=1780964492\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/bc18d7b12a03d19e2764f7c20ee9784d.webm?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/bc18d7b12a03d19e2764f7c20ee9784d.mp4?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional ARPGs Descend's roguelite structure forces you to create your build as you play rather then being directed by a build guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent unlocks aren't just stat boosts, they also influence drop chances of specific Stats, Effects and Items to shape your build towards your goal.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Common, Magic, Rare, and Unique items that alter stats and effects to boost your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items carry powerful effects that can bring a build online and completely change a run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/860e5d4b1e88f010815e697563fde4ef.avif?t=1780964492\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras_big/860e5d4b1e88f010815e697563fde4ef.webp?t=1780964492 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend is an upcoming Roguelite ARPG. It combines the exciting combat, looting and build crafting of a traditional ARPG with a Roguelite run structure. Slay hordes of enemies to gain procedural skills, augments and loot to shape your build and fight deeper. Descend is set apart with a unique skill system, run-altering persistent upgrades, and an evolving quest system that influences gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your character with real time action combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge roll out of the way of attacks, move while casting, use charged skills for more impact, set up devastating damage conditions with status effects, and more. Do all of this with WASD and controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/d873fb4c3e29c3b87abb95a677c4207b.poster.avif?t=1780964492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/d873fb4c3e29c3b87abb95a677c4207b.webm?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/d873fb4c3e29c3b87abb95a677c4207b.mp4?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Skill System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot procedurally generated Skills with dynamically created skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socketed Skill Augments boost not only a Skill's power but dynamically change how it behaves. Turn a Fireball into a multishot projectile, make them bounce off walls, increase their stats, explode on impact and countless more combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/bc18d7b12a03d19e2764f7c20ee9784d.poster.avif?t=1780964492\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/bc18d7b12a03d19e2764f7c20ee9784d.webm?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/bc18d7b12a03d19e2764f7c20ee9784d.mp4?t=1780964492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional ARPGs Descend's roguelite structure forces you to create your build as you play rather then being directed by a build guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent unlocks aren't just stat boosts, they also influence drop chances of specific Stats, Effects and Items to shape your build towards your goal.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Common, Magic, Rare, and Unique items that alter stats and effects to boost your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items carry powerful effects that can bring a build online and completely change a run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras/860e5d4b1e88f010815e697563fde4ef.avif?t=1780964492\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/extras_big/860e5d4b1e88f010815e697563fde4ef.webp?t=1780964492 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Descend beneath a demon-besieged church in this Roguelite ARPG. Create a unique build each run with procedural skills, augments, and loot. Take on hordes of enemies and challenging bosses and unlock persistent upgrades that shape future runs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/1f1ca60dbce8e9ef44e50e4f3f7d46d57c3bb150/header.jpg?t=1780964492", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/a23516e288ffc57ffd22e1f00644413a9b0197e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780964492", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714290/a23516e288ffc57ffd22e1f00644413a9b0197e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780964492", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Fizzy Games"], "publishers": ["Fizzy Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, 